---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import SectionHeading from '../components/SectionHeading.astro';
import CTA from '../components/CTA.astro';
import { stems } from '../data/content';
---
<BaseLayout title="STEM learning" description="Explore robotics, mechatronics, ICT, IoT, automation, 3D printing and science subjects described in MITstem's prospectus.">
  <section class="page-hero page-hero--image"><img class="page-hero__side-image" src="/images/future-drone.webp" alt="" aria-hidden="true" /><div class="container page-hero__content"><p class="eyebrow eyebrow--white"><span class="eyebrow__line"></span>Science + Technology + Engineering + Mathematics</p><h1>The future belongs to the curious.</h1><p>Explore the hands-on, technology-forward learning areas that make STEM part of the MITstem educational vision.</p></div></section>
  <section class="section-space"><div class="container stem-spotlight"><div><p class="eyebrow"><span class="eyebrow__line"></span>Learn through discovery</p><h2>Where ideas become understanding.</h2><p>STEM is more than a collection of subjects. It invites learners to ask better questions, work through challenges, design possible solutions and understand how technology affects everyday life.</p><p>The prospectus highlights areas ranging from robotics and connected technology to industrial automation and digital fabrication, especially within the secondary curriculum.</p><a class="text-link" href="/academics/">See the academic pathway <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div><img src="/images/automation-lab.webp" alt="Learners exploring technical equipment in an engineering workspace" width="395" height="235" loading="lazy" /></div></section>
  <section class="section-space section-soft"><div class="container"><SectionHeading eyebrow="Explore what’s possible" title="Six windows into a changing world." description="These topics are based on the technical and STEM subject." /><div class="stem-grid">{stems.map((item) => <article class="stem-card"><span class="stem-card__num">LEARNING AREA / {item.number}</span><h3>{item.title}</h3><p>{item.description}</p><div class="stem-card__detail">{item.detail}</div></article>)}</div><div class="notice"><span class="notice__symbol">i</span><p><strong>Subject availability: Please request the latest programme details.</p></div></div></section>
  <section class="section-space"><div class="container stem-spotlight"><img src="/images/future-drone.webp" width="910" height="440" loading="lazy" alt="Drone and future technology imagery featured in the MITstem prospectus" /><div><p class="eyebrow"><span class="eyebrow__line"></span>See beyond the classroom</p><h2>Connecting learning to the real world.</h2><p>The school concept also discusses industry study tours, enrichment activities and exposure to future career fields. These experiences can help learners connect science and mathematics with the people and industries using them.</p><p>Specific tours and partnerships referenced in the historical brochure should be treated as proposed examples, not confirmed current arrangements.</p><a class="btn btn--red" href="/contact/">Ask about STEM opportunities <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></div></section>
  <CTA title="Curiosity has no finish line." description="Contact the team for the latest information about STEM programmes, technology learning and opportunities for students." />
</BaseLayout>
